# The repo-root .gitignore ignores dist/ everywhere (generated output).
# The MCP plugin is the exception: it commits ONE prebuilt Node bundle so a
# clean checkout is runnable on plain Node (registry/directory introspection
# like Glama runs under Node, which can't execute the Bun .ts source, and its
# sandbox has no Bun to build one). `verify` rebuilds it so it never drifts.
!dist/
!dist/server.js
